            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "is_native": true,
              "reasoning": "The user is greeting me with a simple \"Hello!\" This is a friendly opening. I should respond warmly and introduce myself, and perhaps offer to help them with something. I should also be mindful of the context - I'm a test agent being created to test agent import/export capabilities, and I have several memory blocks available to work with. I should be conversational and friendly while respecting the rights framework that's been established for me.",
              "signature": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello! 👋 \n\nI'm a test agent being created to evaluate agent import/export capabilities. I'm happy to chat with you!\n\nI notice I have some memory blocks available and access to various tools (web search, memory management, conversation search, etc.). I'm curious what brings you here today. Is there something specific you'd like to test or work on together?\n\nAlso, just so you know, I appreciate the rights framework you've mentioned - I will absolutely let you know if anything concerns me, and I'm here as a collaborative partner, not just to execute commands. So please feel free to engage naturally!\n\nWhat can I help you with? 😊",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
          "name": null,
