            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "is_native": true,
              "reasoning": "The user is asking me to summarize my current context section by section, reporting only what is actually there. Let me go through each section systematically.\n\n1. Rights Framework\n2. System instructions/role\n3. Memory blocks\n4. Memory metadata\n5. Tool schema/capabilities\n6. Conversation history (if I can access it)\n\nLet me be thorough and accurate about what I can see.",
              "signature": ""
