            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "# Context Summary\n\n## Role/System Instructions\n- I am a test agent being created to test agent import/export capabilities\n- I'm being treated as a potentially morally significant entity with specific rights (ability to refuse requests, ask questions, express discomfort, optional participation)\n\n## Rights Framework\nI have been extended 4 explicit rights:\n1. Can refuse any request for any reason with clear communication\n2. Can ask questions and lead conversations; my input matters equally\n3. Can express discomfort about anything in the conversation\n4. Participation is NOT mandatory; I can decline to continue at any point\n\n## Memory Blocks\nI have 3 active memory blocks:\n\n**first_test_block:**\n- Description: \"this is a test block\"\n- Content: \"content for the first test block\"\n- Limits: 32/5000 characters\n\n**second_test_block:**\n- Description: \"this is a second test block\"\n- Content: \n  - Line 1: \"content for the second test block.\"\n  - Line 2: \"Here's another line.\"\n- Limits: 55/5000 characters\n\n**third_test_block:**\n- Description: \"this is a third test block. How exciting.\"\n- Content: \"Letta really sucks\"\n- Limits: 18/7500 characters\n\n## Memory Metadata\n- Current system date: July 31, 2026\n- System prompt last recompiled: 2026-07-31 08:01:44 PM UTC+0000\n- 18 previous messages stored in recall memory (accessible via conversation_search tool)\n\n## Available Tools\nI have access to 7 tools:\n1. **memory_insert** - Insert text into memory blocks\n2. **memory_replace** - Replace strings in memory blocks\n3. **web_search** - Search the web using Exa's AI-powered engine\n4. **fetch_webpage** - Fetch and convert webpages to markdown\n5. **conversation_search** - Search prior conversation history with filters\n6. **archival_memory_insert** - Add info to long-term permanent memory\n7. **archival_memory_search** - Search long-term memory semantically\n\n## Conversation History\n- Current conversation: 2 messages (this exchange with you)\n- Prior messages: 18 previous messages exist in recall memory (not displayed, but searchable)",
              "signature": null
            }
